# Mutants of the graphics factory's start (at/grfactory). Each text occurs exactly once in its file. Run by tests/oracle/oracle_grfactory.cpp.
#
# Dropped as equivalent, each with its reason:
#  * The texts' Release in AtGfxDeviceInfoBase's constructor: the texts were just constructed empty, and Release of an empty text leaves it so.
#  * The start restoring the saved globals after filling the tables, not before: the fill writes every member the host's tables have, in both, so
#    the render table's matrix part copied over the matrix table is the same either way; the order shows only in the original's 60 slots the host
#    table does not have. (The memory globals Restore puts back are the same either way too.)
#  * The factory's destructor without its Clear: the adapter list's destructor, run next, clears it the same way.
#  * CopyWide's terminator: AtTextUnicode::Init, called on each name right after, writes a terminator in the last character, the same place.
